  "translation": "Matsatsing ao Hizkiya o lwala go fihla lehu, gomme moprofeta Yeshayahu, morwa wa Amotse, a tsena go yena, a mmolela a re: Bjoalo a bolela Yahwe: Laela ntlo ya gago, ka gobane o hwetše o tla hwala, gomme o ka se phela.",
